<title>UK: Hambro Countrywide to buy John D.Wood.</title>
<headline>Hambro Countrywide to buy John D.Wood.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British estate agency and financial products group Hambro Countrywide Plc said on Thursday it agreed to buy John D. Wood &amp; Co Ltd in an agreed deal worth about 11.9 million stg.</p>
<p>Hambro said it would offer 145p per share cash for each share of John D. Wood, an estate agency.</p>
</text>
